PROPRIETARY SCOPE

The Core Engine includes, without limitation:

  - Reconciliation spine: observe, plan, safety, apply
  - Safety guarantees and policy enforcement
  - Multi-tenant orchestration
  - Audit trails, compliance artifacts, and hosted service infrastructure
  - Enterprise adapters (AWS, Hetzner, DFIR presets, and SaaS-only integrations)
  - CLI orchestration beyond basic audit/plan against open adapters

